### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### 就绪检查
GET http://localhost:8080/ready

### 单条历史（文件采集器走批量接口，这条用于直接调试）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/history
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: t1

{
  "session_id": "s1",
  "user_id": "u1",
  "role": "user",
  "content": "你好"
}

### 批量历史（文件采集器走这条，推荐）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/history/batch
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: t1

{
  "messages": [
    {"session_id": "s1", "user_id": "u1", "role": "user", "content": "你好"},
    {"session_id": "s1", "user_id": "u1", "role": "assistant", "content": "这是回复"}
  ]
}

### 轨迹
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/traces
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: t1

{
  "request_id": "r1",
  "session_id": "s1",
  "step_type": "tool_call",
  "step_name": "search",
  "duration_ms": 12
}

### 记忆事件
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/memory/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: t1

{
  "entity_id": "u1",
  "entity_type": "user",
  "event_type": "preference",
  "payload": {"lang": "zh"}
}

### 读取实体画像
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/memory/user/u1
X-Tenant-ID: t1

### 读取会话总结（Phase 2：按 session_id 生成"本次对话聊了什么"）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sessions/s1
X-Tenant-ID: t1

### 聚合读取用户上下文：画像 + 该用户全部会话总结
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/u1
X-Tenant-ID: t1

### 轻量管理界面（Swagger UI，从 /openapi.json 加载）
GET http://localhost:8080/docs

### OpenAPI 文档（JSON）
GET http://localhost:8080/openapi.json

### 后台管理界面（用户/画像浏览、会话检索、数据治理；需 admin.enabled=true）
GET http://localhost:8080/admin

### 后台：列出用户与画像
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/api/users
X-Tenant-ID: t1

### 后台：检索会话总结
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/api/sessions?user_id=u1&q=部署
X-Tenant-ID: t1

### 指标（Prometheus 格式）
GET http://localhost:8080/metrics
